{"id":42861759141682,"type":"artist","name":"Jonn Serrie","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"tags":["ambient","Space Ambient","new age","space music","ethereal"],"country":"US","kind":"Person","similar":["Rudy Adrian","David Helpling","Max Corbacho","Jon Jenkins","Thom Brennan","Kevin Kendle","Phillip Wilkerson","Solarsoul","Erik Wøllo","Jeff Pearce"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jonn_Serrie_20110312.jpg?width=500","bio":"Jonn Serrie es de los mas grandes creadores de la música espacial ambiental, su obra incluye varios discos así como videos siempre con el exquisito sonido espacial y a veces con un toque de jazz.Es música muy fina que introduce en escenarios oníricos\nde otros mundos o del mundo del futuro en estado de completo relax e inclusive con un toque realmente sensual como erótico. Es en pocas palabras un genio musical. Su primer disco \"And The Stars Go With You\"(1987)muy bueno."},"works":[{"id":99163168382079,"type":"album","name":"Starmoods","artist":"Jonn Serrie","year":1984,"weight":3,"yt":"4DFAu4oyRGw","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":100525930599399,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","rank":164,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":138912516891204,"type":"album","name":"And the Stars Go With You","artist":"Jonn Serrie","year":1988,"weight":4,"yt":"dkTR_wtF5aI","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":100525930599399,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","rank":19,"scaruffi":null},{"id":273501579136396,"name":"RYM Top — New Age","rank":73,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":222992954425046,"type":"album","name":"Flightpath","artist":"Jonn Serrie","year":1989,"weight":3,"yt":"y11sQrLr3qM","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":100525930599399,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","rank":182,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":46726936314018,"type":"album","name":"Tingri","artist":"Jonn Serrie","year