ras, estados de ánimo, géneros y estilos de vida. Sus parientes: el jazz estético de ECM, John Fahey, el minimalismo y la kosmische musik. Guitarra (Ackerman, Michael Hedges), piano (George Winston, Michael Jones), flauta (Paul Horn), arpa, cuerdas (David Darling) y percusión; conjuntos de cámara (Shadowfax, Turtle Island String Quartet); la electrónica de Los Ángeles (Michael Stearns, Kevin Braheny, Steve Roach, el más metafísico de los mensajeros cósmicos) y la sinfónica (Constance Demby, Novus Magnificat), Robert Rich. La world music de vanguardia: Jon Hassell (Dream Theory In Malaya), Paul Winter, Kitaro, Jeff Greinke, Mark Isham, Michael Brook, Forrest Fang, Jorge Reyes. En Alemania, Peter Frohmader y los herederos de la música cósmica.","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#new-age"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":46726936314018,"artist":"Jonn Serrie","artist_id":42861759141682,"title":"Tingri","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"qz0ejqtuL9s","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"New age y world music","scene_id":135695620098166,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#new-age","chapters":["Sección 5.19"],"pages":[[1,204,null]]}],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":99163168382079,"type":"album","name":"Starmoods","list_id":100525930599399,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","src":"musthear","rank":164,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"4DFAu4oyRGw","scaruffi":null},{"id":138912516891204,"type":"album","name":"And the Stars Go With You","list_id":100525930599399,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Space Ambient","src":"musthear","rank":19,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"dkTR_wtF5aI","scaruffi":null},{"id":138912516891204,"type":"album","name":"And the Stars Go With You","list_id":273501579136396,"list":"RYM Top — New Age","src":"musthear","rank":7